Jill’s annual salary is  

\[
\begin{aligned}
\text{Teaching:}&\;20\text{ dollars/hour} \times 35\text{ hours/week} \times 50\text{ weeks} = \$35{,}000 \\
\text{Coaching:}&\;30\text{ dollars/hour} \times 15\text{ hours/week} \times 50\text{ weeks} = \$22{,}500 \\
\text{Total:}&\; \$35{,}000 + \$22{,}500 = \boxed{\$57{,}500}
\end{aligned}
\]

The average shoe size is  

\[
\frac{5 \text{ (Sophie)} + 5 \times 5 \text{ (Charlie)}}{2}
= \frac{5 + 25}{2}
= \frac{30}{2}
= 15.
\]

**Answer: 15**.
